OL,3,GNEWSAShop closures among concerns in
OL,4,Aancient capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe increasing number of empty shops,
OL,7,Fparking provision, and the rising cost
OL,8,Fof living have been raised as issues
OL,9,Ffacing voters in Arbory, Castletown and
OL,10,FMalew.
OL,12,FAlthough stretching out to include the
OL,13,Ftwo parishes, at the heart of the
OL,14,Fsouthern constituency is the ancient
OL,15,Fcapital of the Isle of Man.
OL,17,FBoasting Georgian and Victorian
OL,18,Farchitecture and overlooked by the
OL,19,FMedieval fortress Castle Rushen,
OL,20,Fconcerns have been raised over a severe
OL,21,Fdecline in the number shops in
OL,22,FCastletown's centre.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
